<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA MAKE 191 FOR NINE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA MAKE 191 FOR NINE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India made 191 for nine from 50 overs against South Africa in the day/night final of the triangular series at Kingsmead on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 191 for nine (50 overs).</p>
</text>
